==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
In {{AoC}}, the Radiant Shirt is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and is obtained the first time the [[Warrior]]s complete the [[Challenge]] "[[Deep Woods, Deep Shadow]]". It can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], and glows in the dark due to a  dye made of [[Luminous Stone]]s.<ref name="AoC Allies"/>

